Patch mode: comparisons use only the source lines quoted in the
patches.

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
*    DELTA DIFFERENCES                                            *
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
Signs mark edits made by only that patch. A sign-less line with one
number is an edit both patches make: a new number means both add
it, an old number means both remove it.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 old new│file.c                  ┃ old new│file.c
        │Old mode: 100644        ┃        │Old mode: 100755
        │New mode: 100755        ┃        │New mode: 100644
        │@@                      ┃        │@@
   1   1│#include <stdio.h>      ┃        │
-  2    │int main() { return 0; }┃        │
+      2│int main() { return 1; }┃        │
   3   3│/* end */               ┃        │
